        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Sanchi</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 250 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Commissioned by the Mauryan emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashoka">Ashoka</a>; enlarged under the Shungas; the carved gateways raised under the Satavahanas, with carving by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ivory-trade">ivory</a> workers of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vidisha">Vidisha</a> and donations from local people, monks and nuns</span></div>
