          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where it is now</span><span class="info-stat-val">On a hilltop at Sanchi Town, Raisen District, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madhya-pradesh">Madhya Pradesh</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>, 46 kilometres northeast of Bhopal; some pieces are in the Sanchi Archaeological Museum, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/victoria-and-albert-museum">Victoria and Albert Museum</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-museum">British Museum</a></span></div>
